---
title: 'FEAR-LESS-HOPE: Framing Time'
subtitle: German-Armenian exchange project and travelling exhibition
artists: Vahram Aghasyan, Greta Harutyunyan, Anas Kahal, Johannes Weilandt
startDate: 2025-10-10
endDate: 2025-10-12
location: bromberghof
gallery: []
---
Four artists were invited to contribute to the German-Armenian exchange project and travelling exhibition FEAR–LESS–HOPE: Framing Time, reflecting on how fear and hope coexist in a world shaped by crises, change, transformation, and experiences of both distance and closeness.

The exhibition presents three video works and one interactive performance.
